WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,700
Feihuang Han is not afraid of death, there are too many

2
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,900
I'll mobilize a large force and come over to destroy it.

3
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,620
That's fine, I don't have to worry about you here.

4
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:22,760
General, it's already night, why have you summoned us?

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,360
Night attack on Huangying

6
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,420
Feihuang has three or four generations of us

7
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:29,250
Where is the lone hero Shi Kelang?

8
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:31,450
Shi Kelang has already attacked the camp

9
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,250
Full speed support, departure

10
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:39,540
Feihuang is not afraid of death and is tireless

11
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,740
Could Shi Kelang be trapped?

12
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,340
We also have a day to rescue the lone hero

13
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,740
Feeling much better

14
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:50,620
Shut up, the Feihuang camp is ahead
